<section class="section" id="about"><div class="wrap"><div class="feature-band reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">Our story · Kitwe, Zambia</div><h2>Quality sound.<br><span class="grad">Global vibes.</span></h2><p>Founded in 2020 as Hi-Tech Studio, High-Tech Entertainment has grown into an independent creative company connecting music production, artist development, digital promotion and software development. Led by producer and CEO L Junior ZM (L Junior Zambia), HTE helps ideas move from the first beat to a finished release.</p><p class="genre-note">OUR SOUND: AFROBEAT · DANCEHALL · DRILL · CHOIR</p><p class="vocal-project-note"><span>CHOIR &amp; VOCAL IDENTITY</span> The Golden Vocals</p></div><a class="btn gold" href="#booking">Start a project</a></div>
<div class="team-grid" aria-label="Leadership and creative team"><article class="team-card"><span>FOUNDER &amp; CEO</span><h3>L Junior ZM</h3><p>Producer and creative lead.</p></article><article class="team-card"><span>MANAGEMENT</span><h3>Mr Michael Clayton</h3><p>Management and operations.</p></article></div></div></section>

<section class="section" id="process"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>From idea to <span class="grad">release.</span></h2><p>A clear path so you always know what happens next.</p></div></div><div class="steps reveal">
<div class="step"><h3>Tell us</h3><p>Send a booking request or WhatsApp us your idea, service and budget.</p></div><div class="step"><h3>Plan</h3><p>We reply to confirm scope, date and next steps. Nothing is booked until we confirm.</p></div><div class="step"><h3>Create</h3><p>Record, produce, mix and master with the HTE team.</p></div><div class="step"><h3>Release</h3><p>Get release-ready audio and promotion support to reach listeners.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="booking"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div class="contact-copy reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Studio &amp; artist services</div><h2>Book with us.</h2><p>Request a studio session, beat production, audio engineering, artist promotion or a collaboration. This sends a booking request to the High Tech Entertainment founder inbox; your date is not confirmed until we reply.</p>
<div class="service-grid" aria-label="Available services"><article class="service-card"><h3>Studio sessions</h3><p>Recording support for vocals and music projects.</p></article><article class="service-card"><h3>Beat production</h3><p>Original instrumentals shaped around your sound.</p></article><article class="service-card"><h3>Mixing &amp; mastering</h3><p>Clarity and release-ready finishing.</p></article><article class="service-card"><h3>Artist development</h3><p>Creative direction and release campaigns.</p></article><article class="service-card"><h3>Spotify &amp; digital promotion</h3><p>Help releases reach more listeners.</p></article><article class="service-card"><h3>Software development</h3><p>Digital products for creative businesses.</p></article><article class="service-card"><h3>Music video &amp; content</h3><p>Visuals and content for your music.</p></article><article class="service-card"><h3>Collaborations</h3><p>Creative partnerships and new ideas.</p></article></div></div>
<div class="panel reveal"><form id="booking-form" data-public-booking="true"><div class="hte-honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this field empty<input name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><div class="form-grid">
